2d:["$","p","You can usually buy FASTag from particip",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"You can usually buy FASTag from participating banks, authorised Point of Sale (POS) locations, or bank apps/websites that list FASTag products. Prefer well-known bank issuers over unknown roadside sellers who ask for OTP or remote access to your phone."}]
2e:["$","p","Activation links the tag ID to your vehi",{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Activation links the tag ID to your vehicle number and a wallet or account. Complete KYC when asked (PAN/Aadhaar as required by the issuer). After activation, do a small test recharge and confirm the vehicle number shown in the app matches your RC before your first long highway trip."}]
